index ea1a1a0..386e084 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,23 @@ Semantic Versioning.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add `v1.Files.Upload`, which takes a file name and a reader and builds the
+  `multipart/form-data` body itself, like `v1.CallLogs.AddRecording`. The body
+  is buffered so it can be replayed, which makes uploads retryable on
+  429/5xx responses.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- File uploads are now retried on 429/5xx responses when retries are enabled.
+  Previously upload request bodies built from readers such as `os.File` had no
+  way to be replayed, so the retry transport sent them once and surfaced the
+  rate-limit error immediately. Seekable bodies passed to `Raw().Do` (and the
+  raw `v1.Files.Add`/`v1.Files.Update`) are now rewound and resent between
+  attempts, and are no longer closed by the client; the caller owns them.
+  Bodies that can only be read once, such as pipes, are still sent once.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
